  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0-preview.1: Real-world adoption release. New companion package PostQuantum.Jwt.AspNetCore brings AddPqJwtBearer(...) and an HTTP-fetched key ring so post-quantum JWT validation slots into the standard ASP.NET Core auth pipeline. AOT/trim-safe annotations on the reflection-using WithClaim(object?) overload plus an AOT-safe WithClaim<T>(JsonTypeInfo<T>) overload. CycloneDX SBOM now packed inside the .nupkg. Property-based tests on top of the deterministic suite (68 tests total). Containerised Linux PQ-required CI lane (OpenSSL 3.5+ via conda-forge) joins the Windows lane in proving the cryptographic paths run in CI. Release workflow has an optional author-signing hook (NUGET_SIGNING_CERT). Full notes: https://github.com/systemslibrarian/postquantum-jwt/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md — known limitations: https://github.com/systemslibrarian/postquantum-jwt/blob/main/KNOWN-GAPS.md.",
